# Factory UI rules

Musts while editing Project Factory chrome. Detail: `knowledge/factory-ui.md`. Why: ADR-0016.

- Use Factory CSS tokens from `factory/tokens.css` (`--factory-*`, `--stage-*`) — do not invent a second palette or redefine tokens in component modules.
- Colocate Factory styles in `*.module.css` next to the page/component; shared chrome via `factory/Shell.module.css`.
- Match `agents_flow` shell language: dark zinc panels, indigo accent, Pipeline left rail, per-stage colors.
- Items / CRUD pages stay on default `web-ui` / cream classes — do not force Factory dark theme onto Items.
- Use Ant Design for Factory form controls (themed via `factory/antd-theme.ts`, ADR-0018).
- Use Phosphor icons (`@phosphor-icons/react`) for Pipeline stage marks and landing CTA — map via `factory/icons.ts`.
- Ideation enhance: `Enhance with AI` → compare → use/keep (`factory-ui` + remote `POST /ideas/refine`).
